'''Kyojuro Rengoku''' is a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 15.1 Update#Version 15.1.1 Update|Version 15.1.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 846
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Kyojuro Rengoku
|name2 = Kyojuro Rengoku CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Kyojuro Rengoku CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Kyojuro Rengoku is an [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]]/[[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Alien]] ranged rusher with a blazing fast attack rate. His DPS against targets is already respectable in its own right, made even better by an [[Omni Strike]] with 50 forward pierce. His guaranteed [[Barrier Breaker]] makes him absolutely phenomenal against the [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]] in [[Cats of the Cosmos]], given his very solid stats through [[Strong Against]] (9,787 effective DPS at Lv.30) and standing range. Kyojuro Rengoku effortlessly melts through hordes of [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark enemies]] without ever giving them the chance to attack, and most [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] are simply unable to push through his massive HP count without abilities like Warp.

What one might notice, however, is his 150% [[Strengthen]] that activates at 33% HP, bringing his general DPS to a whopping ~13,600 at Lv.30; against targets, this number grows to an absurd ~24,500. This boost makes him an absolute monster in his last reposition, preventing pretty much any enemy from ever reaching him unless they already outrange him. At Lv.50, while strengthened, expect him to keep on fighting until the sun comes up.

{{Job|Classification = Rusher & Backliner}}

